{"title":"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_(2)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution (2)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddda1f7497c0a77bdf9248dee2371ca06bcbbc74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> (meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> takes positive real numbers to positive real numbers) be a nonconstant function such that for any positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbfc1781f9e0e0468cfe295fe4242ac8843e1cd2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)f(y)f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)-f(x+y).\\]\" width=\"346\" height=\"18\" />Prove that there is a constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8726d98aced2f3140dd77a2d8614c2e7674700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f53c551cb8a20af7ac1680b0189a9195cae3b7fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=\\frac{a^x-1}{a^x+1}\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />for all positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/4827ef9ccc0a7c47018fc5b1b98275d6f862cddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)f(y)f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)-f(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"345\" height=\"20\" />, we can find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc11c69980791dce2103382a323199dff5ecde09.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x+y)=\\frac{f(x)+f(y)}{1+f(x)*f(y)}\\]\" width=\"211\" height=\"43\" />\nIt's obvious that if there exists two real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, which satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f53c551cb8a20af7ac1680b0189a9195cae3b7fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=\\frac{a^x-1}{a^x+1}\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd3de3e55e294e80aa44dca9f7ab616ac963ec0f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(y)=\\frac{a^y-1}{a^y+1}\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Then, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd1b4d3aa4b63da184a9670452ea2f70eb8752d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc11c69980791dce2103382a323199dff5ecde09.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x+y)=\\frac{f(x)+f(y)}{1+f(x)*f(y)}\\]\" width=\"211\" height=\"43\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/456eeb679ceea07a7476d96d955262a44db8b8be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x+y)=\\frac{2*a^x*a^y-2}{2*a^x*a^y+2}\\]\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/0/b70ae446b70a7dbc6d2be06f193c032f763352ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x+y)=\\frac{a^x*a^y-1}{a^x*a^y+1}\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The fraction is also satisfies for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd1b4d3aa4b63da184a9670452ea2f70eb8752d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Then, we can solve this problem using mathematical induction\n</p><p>~~Andy666\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.282.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(2)\">Solution (2)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (2)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/22166de275af93fd76cecb18e983e08ef3172ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x_0,y_0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" /> denote a substitution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/d/6edc8aba010ffa203aa5e6190484b8bede9a3561.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_0,y_0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the inverse of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> when it exists.\n</p><p>By <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/6/9b6554369bec190741824e97f761b34bc6b14970.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x,x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/0230d7fb90cc207fd96b755f0041537bb7f1e9ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> so the domain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />(x) must be in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128206b7583760e7ef76e802861294c334f7ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" /> interval\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b43e89b3500f4052d6fbf066f504d35ecc90743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(g(x),g(y)); g(x)+g(y)=g(\\frac{x+y}{1+xy})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"305\" height=\"41\" />(*) from here, \n</p><p>Taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2c93acb38741d141b87ac6e2827e2168e99d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x} and \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y};$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"86\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/382d5ef575377a35df4f8df618596b9baefa039e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g^\\prime(x)=\\frac{1(1+xy)-y(x+y)}{(1+xy)^2}=\\frac{1-y^2}{(1+xy)^2}, g^\\prime(y)=\\frac{1(1+xy)-x(x+y)}{(1+xy)^2}=\\frac{1-x^2}{(1+xy)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"671\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bdebaae77d602ade25d062aad338731a024faea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{g^\\prime(x)}{g^\\prime(y)}=\\frac{1-y^2}{1-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"122\" height=\"45\" /> so let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/d/11d93e062770630886c965bc78a9aa455be43c18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g^\\prime(x)(1-x^2)=g^\\prime(y)(1-y^2)=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"262\" height=\"21\" /> for some real constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/e/67e6630318d8cb28de2723180b6d359b972489c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af0746b1e04fdaa4b2334f237c6b8a9160e47c63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=\\int{\\frac{k}{1-x^2}}dx=kartanh(x)+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"299\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><br />\nby substitution into (*);  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67f90a04069112bdd28f95f76696fff2cdc6acd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kartanh(x)+kartanh(y)+2c=kartanh(\\frac{x+y}{1+xy})+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"433\" height=\"41\" /> we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f87be4c954bcdab3034ff729b05b347f03ef0104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$artanh(x)+artanh(y)=artanh(\\frac{x+y}{1+xy})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"334\" height=\"41\" />  so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/700e719cf1076ee20f8e4a0ef72a3301c809082e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c}{k}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"34\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b64d30c07ba380cebe20cfa6a8950dcf5f9f8a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=0,k\\neq0;g(x)=kartanh(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<pre>so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/7/9775419562748f9d2ef14f5444259bd914fc8c53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=tanh(\\frac{x}{k})=\\frac{{(e^\\frac{1}{k})}^x-1}{{(e^\\frac{1}{k})}^x+1}=\\frac{a^x-1}{a^x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"307\" height=\"50\" />\n</pre>\n<p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6c8656499bd176593416414b3ebaee43d30475d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=e^{\\frac{1}{k}}&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>-Shushninja\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO\" title=\"2020 CAMO\">2020 CAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All CAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO (page does not exist)\">2020 CJMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CJMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CJMO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CJMO_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CJMO Problems and Solutions (page does not exist)\"> All CJMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017023618\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 277/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1927/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 103/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8026/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.650      1 -total\n 73.99%   28.598      1 Template:CJMO_newbox\n 18.91%    7.307      1 Template:CAMO_newbox\n  6.22%    2.403      1 Template:MAC_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19649:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017023618 and revision id 227097. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}